# Probe run outputs. Generated by scripts/assess.mts against live third-party
# servers: large, machine-written, and re-derivable from a run. They are also
# written incrementally DURING a run, so a commit mid-run captures a partial
# file that is stale the moment it lands. The reproducibility envelope is the
# seed plus the rubric version, not the checked-in bytes.
assessment*.json
transcripts/
